    "summary": "This Gambit allows the Controlling Player to score additional Combat Resolution Points if they are the winner of a Challenge.",
    "description": "While this Gambit is selected, if the enemy Model is Removed as a Casualty during the Strike Step, during the subsequent Glory Step, the Controlling Player gains 2 additional Combat Resolution Points.",
