    "description": "**Setup:** Each Frag Minefield Marker must be set up by the Player that selected it at the end of the Prepare the Battlefield Step of the Mission Sequence.\n\n**Effect:** If a Unit ends a move with one or more Models within 6\" of the centre of a Frag Minefield Marker, the Controlling Player of that Unit must roll one Dice for each Model from such a Unit that is within 6\" of the centre of that Frag Minefield Marker. On a 1, that Model triggers a mine. Centre a 3\" Blast Marker on that Model. Every Unit that has any Models under one of these Blast Markers suffers 1 Hit for each Model from that Unit that is under each Blast Marker. Each such Hit has a Strength of 5, an AP of 5, and a Damage of 1.\n\n**How To Destroy:** Once these its have been resolved, the Controlling Player of the Moving Unit rolls a Dice. On a 4+, that Frag Minefield Marker is removed from the Battlefield.\n\n**Traits:** Defender, Minefield",
