    "summary": "\"The White Scars Player may increase their Model's Movement Characteristic.\"",
    "description": "At the start of any of the Controlling Player's Turns, that Player may choose to increase the Movement Characteristic of any Model with this Special Rule and a Base Movement Characteristic of at least 1 and apply a modifier of +2 to that Characteristic until the end of that Player Turn.",
