    "summary": "",
    "description": "A Model with a Saturnine teleportation transponder has the Deep Strike Special Rule. While such a Model has joined a Saturnine Terminator Squad Unit in Reserves, Saturnine Terminator and Saturnine Terminator Sergeant Models in that Unit also gain the Deep Strike Special Rule.",
