    "summary": "\"This Gambit allows Hibou Khan to avoid being Removed as a Casualty.\"",
    "description": "While this Gambit is selected, if this Model is reduced to 0 Wounds in Step 4 of the Strike Step, its Controlling Player can roll a Dice. On a result of 4+, this Model is not Removed as a Casualty but instead remains Engaged in the Challenge with a Wounds Characteristic of 1 and its Controlling Player gains Challenge Advantage.",
