    "name": "Soul Binding",
    "aliases": [],
    "summary": "",
    "description": "**Trigger:** The Active Player may choose to Manifest the Soul Binding Psychic Power in the Assault Phase, at the start of the Declare Weapons and Set Initiative Steps Step of the Fight Sub-Phase\n\n**Focus:** The Focus of the Power must be a Zardu Layak Model.\n\n**Target:** The Target Unit must be an enemy Unit in the same Combat as the Focus Model.\n\n**Duration:** If successfully Manifested, the effects of this Psychic Power last until the end of the Make Final Pile-in Moves Step of that Combat.\n\n**Process:** 1. Once the Focus and Target Unit have been decided, the Target Unit’s Controlling Player makes a Resistance Check for that Unit.\n2. If the Resistance Check is failed, the Controlling Player of the Focus Model can select one Model with a Willpower Characteristic of 7 or less from the Target Unit.\n3. For the Duration of this Psychic Power, the selected Model is considered to be under the control of the Controlling Player of the Focus of this Power.\n4. If the Resistance Check succeeds then there is no further effect.",
